{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Normal NPC\n🐦 Blue-and-yellow-striped monster bird (\"Striped Bird\" according to some fans, \"spr_normalnpc\" in the game files).","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Normal_NPC.webp","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":166,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Gaster (W. D. Gaster)**\nHis design is practically identical to Gaster Follower #3 from Undertale, except for the color and a less unsettling smile — the only Gaster Follower with no playable \"normal\" counterpart in…","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Onionsan**\nShares an almost identical cryptic line with Onionsan's last words before his disappearance, and his takoyaki stand in Ch.5 tastes, according to Susie, \"like raw onion\" — the basis of the…","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Is he a Gaster Follower?**\nGaster Follower #3 from Undertale is the only one of the three Followers without a playable \"normal\" (non-Goner) counterpart in that game — and Normal NPC fits almost perfectly into that visual gap.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**What happened to Onionsan?**\nA speculative and fairly macabre fan theory: the line Normal NPC repeats matches Onionsan's speech right before he disappeared, and his takoyaki stand in Ch.5 \"tastes like raw onion\" — which has…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Deltarune_-_Sprite_-_Onionsan_-_Kawaii.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2_x0","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3_x1","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}